=== reject/cellpaths/closure-head.nu
shape shape_closure 0..4 "{|| "
shape shape_external 4..6 "1}"
shape shape_externalarg 6..9 ".0?"
error nu::parser::unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed delimiter.
  label 0..1 "{": unclosed — opens here (need `}`)
  label 9..9 "": expected `}` here
  help: Add a matching `}` to close this delimiter, or check that an earlier closer closed the wrong block.
error nu::parser::unbalanced_delimiter: Unbalanced delimiter.
  label 5..6 "}": unexpected `}` (unbalanced with `{`)
  help: Remove this `}` if it is extra, or add a matching `{` earlier. If you closed a block too early, the real mistake may be above.
=== reject/cellpaths/member-is-paren.nu
